Milestone 4:
✔ Remove greedy meshing @done(26-04-28 22:27)
    70 FPS, 440 MB at 32 Chunks
    18FPS 1.3 GB at 64 Chunks

✔ Add 2d Heightmaps instead of 3d @done(26-04-29 14:05)
    9 FPS 3.2 GB at 64 Chunks

✔ Add persistent work thread pool @done(26-04-29 14:22)
    9 FPS 3.2 GB at 64 Chunks

✔ Compress the vertex format from 28 bytes to 4 bytes @done(26-04-29 14:46)
    12 FPS 1.5 GB at 64 Chunks

☐ Fast-Path Culling
    Implement a 2D "broad-phase" distance check before
    the expensive 3D frustum check.

☐ Texture Array
    Switch from an array of samplers to 
    GL_TEXTURE_2D_ARRAY to allow more efficient 
    texture indexing in the shader.

☐ Heightmap Cache
    Share heightmaps between adjacent chunks during
    generation to eliminate redundant noise 
    calculations.
